{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Rogues</strong> is a challenging <strong>dark rogue-lite dungeon crawler</strong> with <strong>rpg</strong> and <strong>bullet hell</strong> elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat all enemies, room by room, and claim the reward you deserve!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game lets you explore 4 exciting floors, each with its own unique set of enemies. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/e8f7e7c8437544675f6447226d886ea7.poster.avif?t=1771791738\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/e8f7e7c8437544675f6447226d886ea7.webm?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/e8f7e7c8437544675f6447226d886ea7.mp4?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and play as <strong>10 unique</strong> animals!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your adventure with 10 different animals, each boasting unique passive abilities. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/b64ba0c534e17c9f6ef9a661865fffb8.avif?t=1771791738\" width=616 height=225 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover slot machines, roll the dice, and let fate take the wheel!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>14 stats</strong> to increase. Collect keys, flowers, and gems along the way!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/b4661df81d38fc4173f1260829be4d51.poster.avif?t=1771791738\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/b4661df81d38fc4173f1260829be4d51.webm?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/b4661df81d38fc4173f1260829be4d51.mp4?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the art of <strong>spawning portals</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap between dimensions, fast travelling and <strong>ambushing foes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0b95d759c44c07d47b2b36122e0d348e.poster.avif?t=1771791738\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0b95d759c44c07d47b2b36122e0d348e.webm?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0b95d759c44c07d47b2b36122e0d348e.mp4?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose among over <strong>200 items</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect arcane relics pulsing with forbidden energy.  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0fb6698bf7b6c5e24ec620cf3f382f8a.poster.avif?t=1771791738\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0fb6698bf7b6c5e24ec620cf3f382f8a.webm?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0fb6698bf7b6c5e24ec620cf3f382f8a.mp4?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>10 different animals with unique passive abilities!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>40 unique enemies</strong>, twisted by malefic forces, hungry for your demise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><strong>Hidden Treasures</strong></strong>: As you descend, discover bizarre and interactive objects strewn across the cursed landscape. Spin the <strong>Slot of Destiny</strong>, where luck can turn the tide of battle. Roll the Dice, find keys, flowers and gems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><strong>Magical Artifacts</strong></strong>: Collect arcane relics that pulse with forbidden energy. Choose among over <strong>200 items</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><strong>Portals to the Unknown</strong></strong>: Master the art of portal-spawning. Leap between dimensions, fast travelling and <strong>ambushing foes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all the <strong>challenges </strong>to obtain even more gems and buy <strong>power ups</strong> to become immortal!!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820630?t=1771791738","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820630?t=1771791738","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/4e6dd74ef6ad16f3e88407873d0bcf5cc46a5225/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771791738","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/4e6dd74ef6ad16f3e88407873d0bcf5cc46a5225/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771791738","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2908910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Rogues</strong> is a challenging <strong>dark rogue-lite dungeon crawler</strong> with <strong>rpg</strong> and <strong>bullet hell</strong> elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat all enemies, room by room, and claim the reward you deserve!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game lets you explore 4 exciting floors, each with its own unique set of enemies. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/e8f7e7c8437544675f6447226d886ea7.poster.avif?t=1771791738\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/e8f7e7c8437544675f6447226d886ea7.webm?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/e8f7e7c8437544675f6447226d886ea7.mp4?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and play as <strong>10 unique</strong> animals!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your adventure with 10 different animals, each boasting unique passive abilities. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/b64ba0c534e17c9f6ef9a661865fffb8.avif?t=1771791738\" width=616 height=225 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover slot machines, roll the dice, and let fate take the wheel!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>14 stats</strong> to increase. Collect keys, flowers, and gems along the way!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/b4661df81d38fc4173f1260829be4d51.poster.avif?t=1771791738\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/b4661df81d38fc4173f1260829be4d51.webm?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/b4661df81d38fc4173f1260829be4d51.mp4?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the art of <strong>spawning portals</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap between dimensions, fast travelling and <strong>ambushing foes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0b95d759c44c07d47b2b36122e0d348e.poster.avif?t=1771791738\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0b95d759c44c07d47b2b36122e0d348e.webm?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0b95d759c44c07d47b2b36122e0d348e.mp4?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose among over <strong>200 items</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect arcane relics pulsing with forbidden energy.  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0fb6698bf7b6c5e24ec620cf3f382f8a.poster.avif?t=1771791738\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0fb6698bf7b6c5e24ec620cf3f382f8a.webm?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/extras/0fb6698bf7b6c5e24ec620cf3f382f8a.mp4?t=1771791738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>10 different animals with unique passive abilities!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>40 unique enemies</strong>, twisted by malefic forces, hungry for your demise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><strong>Hidden Treasures</strong></strong>: As you descend, discover bizarre and interactive objects strewn across the cursed landscape. Spin the <strong>Slot of Destiny</strong>, where luck can turn the tide of battle. Roll the Dice, find keys, flowers and gems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><strong>Magical Artifacts</strong></strong>: Collect arcane relics that pulse with forbidden energy. Choose among over <strong>200 items</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><strong>Portals to the Unknown</strong></strong>: Master the art of portal-spawning. Leap between dimensions, fast travelling and <strong>ambushing foes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all the <strong>challenges </strong>to obtain even more gems and buy <strong>power ups</strong> to become immortal!!</p></li></ul>","developers":["manProduction"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820630/header.jpg?t=1771791738","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2820630/1738001583/e2b53cb065469df194cc06aa919323a33f860ccb/1771781809/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771783165","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2820630/173